{"body":"# Fix WebTransport session cleanup\n\n- [ ] You've read the [Contributor Guide](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) and [Code of Conduct](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/main/CODE-OF-CONDUCT.md).\n- [x] You've included unit or integration tests for your change, where applicable.\n- [ ] You've included inline docs for your change, where applicable.\n- [ ] There's an open issue for the PR that you are making. If you'd like to propose a new feature or change, please open an issue to discuss the change or find an existing issue.\n\nSummary of the changes (Less than 80 chars)\n\n## Description\n\nFixes WebTransport session cleanup.\n\n- Remove a `WebTransportSession` from `Http3Connection` when it closes gracefully or aborts.\n- Snapshot sessions before connection-wide cleanup so session removal does not mutate an active enumeration.\n- Add coverage for graceful and aborted session cleanup.\n\nFixes N/A","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOAQzde88AAAABbqVBxA","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"<!-- aspnetcore-pr-docs-check -->\n✅ No documentation PR was created.\n\n**Confidence that documentation is needed:** 5%\n\nNo docs needed: internal bug fix for WebTransport session cleanup, with tests. No signals detected.\n\n**Documentation surfaces considered**\n\n* **Conceptual article:** Not required — Internal Kestrel files only; no public API or documented behavior change.\n* **Migration guidance:** Not required — No user action needed when upgrading.\n* **Breaking change:** Not required — No compatibility impact; internal cleanup fix.","createdAt":"2026-10-13T17:27:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/69708#issuecomment-6151291332","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"files":[{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/Core/src/Internal/Http3/Http3Connection.cs","additions":39,"deletions":5,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/Core/src/Internal/WebTransport/WebTransportSession.cs","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/test/InMemory.FunctionalTests/Http3/WebTransport/WebTransportSessionTests.cs","additions":65,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/test/InMemory.FunctionalTests/Http3/WebTransport/WebTransportTestUtilities.cs","additions":30,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"mergeCommit":{"oid":"03c314bbe77aa36fffe1c97e56edd8e548d3017c"},"mergedAt":"2026-10-13T17:21:50Z","number":69708,"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDOAQzde88AAAABRL-4bw","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nLate streams referencing removed sessions can trigger connection-wide cleanup and abort unrelated requests.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open finding</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.png\" alt=\"High severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Late WebTransport stream closes the entire HTTP/3 connection](#discussion_r4212005818) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nFixes WebTransport session cleanup in Kestrel’s HTTP/3 connections.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Removes sessions when they close or abort.\n- Snapshots sessions before connection-wide cleanup.\n- Adds coverage for session removal.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| src/​Servers/​Kestrel/​test/​InMemory.FunctionalTests/​Http3/​WebTransport/​WebTransportSessionTests.cs | Tests graceful and aborted session removal. |\r\n| src/​Servers/​Kestrel/​Core/​src/​Internal/​WebTransport/​WebTransportSession.cs | Removes closed sessions from their connection. |\r\n| src/​Servers/​Kestrel/​Core/​src/​Internal/​Http3/​Http3Connection.cs | Adds removal, snapshot, and test-count helpers. |\n</details>\n\n🧠 **Review effort:** Balanced","submittedAt":"2026-10-07T21:08:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"74c784ba41b214def51987a9b6da82cc0f6f4fc8"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDOAQzde88AAAABRMwT-g","author":{"login":"BrennanConroy"},"authorAssociation":"MEMBER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-10-07T22:28:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"a3d5eb5e47bb6ddcdc7b44142b73e4cee4439f0d"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDOAQzde88AAAABRfHoNw","author":{"login":"DeagleGross"},"authorAssociation":"MEMBER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-10-09T09:46:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"APPROVED","commit":{"oid":"a3d5eb5e47bb6ddcdc7b44142b73e4cee4439f0d"}}],"state":"MERGED","title":"Fix WebTransport session cleanup","url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/69708"}
